li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gotta Snatch ’Em All:</strong> Catalog the colorful fauna and uncover its weird origin. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discovery:</strong> Long forgotten tunnels, giant skeletons, holes in space and time, and, yes, even a burger joint is here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snackable:</strong> Play a tight gaming experience, perfect for some evenings or a long weekend!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.............................................................................................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi it's Jonas, the developer! :)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>HEART DRIVE has been a passion project of mine for some time now - it's something I put all my love into. I'm so excited to show it the world now! If you want to stay in touch, or have questions, follow me on Bluesky or Insta, or message me with the linked mail adress. Wishlists help a lot, as always, and look out for any future demo!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>See you, tape fishers! ✌️🎣🚗</i></p>", "short_description": "Catch giant fish from the top of your car, upgrade your equipment and uncover the mystery behind the legendary „Heart Drive“. Embark on a roadtrip of action, friendship and letting go, in this fast-paced driving spin on the fishing genre.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/9a2411599082d16a5ac979ef0158b380e538a2d5/header.jpg?t=1787092469", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/44eae8f473fac73d2506c90c2e82b8b414ef2f59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787092469", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/44eae8f473fac73d2506c90c2e82b8b414ef2f59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787092469", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1080</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["by Jonas Pfeiffer"], "publishers": ["by Jonas Pfeiffer"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "9", "description": "Racing"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/79d81071f7a6d22daebf85163adbdb67cad48e5f/ss_79d81071f7a6d22daebf85163adbdb67cad48e5f.600x338.jpg?t=1787092469", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/79d81071f7a6d22daebf85163adbdb67cad48e5f/ss_79d81071f7a6d22daebf85163adbdb67cad48e5f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787092469"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/ba5405f61ae3aa9928bb3d7621e025d6c078e76a/ss_ba5405f61ae3aa9928bb3d7621e025d6c078e76a.600x338.jpg?t=1787092469", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026760/ba5405f61ae3aa9928bb3d7621e025d6c078e76a/ss_ba5405f61ae3aa9928bb3d7621e025d6c078e76a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787092469"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a